  "h1_seo": "Rock Marble Coffee Table by Rugiano",
  "descripcion_seo": "The Rock is a Rugiano coffee table with an irregular, pebble-like top resting on two bronzed brass legs. Made in Italy.\nTWO TOPS, TWO LOOKS\n • Marble table top in 19 marbles, from Travertino and Emperador Dark (category A) to Calacatta Gold (B) and Patagonia or Calcite St Barth (C).\n • A hand-painted wood table top in Rugiano's Decoro technique, with 11 designs inspired by painters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Botticelli.\nWHICH SIZE\n The three large sizes are 11\" high, for a low sofa. The small one (size C) is 14 1/8\" high and works as a side table next to an armchair.",
