  "h1_seo": "Club Sofa with Brass Tube Frame by Rugiano",
  "descripcion_seo": "A club style sofa with straight lines and a frame of brushed brass or bronze tubes that outline the upholstery. If you are comparing Rugiano sofas, this is the one where the metal frame is the design.\nFITS MORE ROOMS THAN IT LOOKS\n At 33 1/2\" deep, this club couch is shallower than most luxury sofas. That makes it a good choice for apartments and narrow living rooms. It comes in four widths, from a 2-seater to the 4-seater Major.\nUPHOLSTERY\n Fabric (categories A and B) or leather (C and D). You can also send your own fabric or leather (C.O.M. / C.O.L.).",
