  "descripcion_seo": "The Hermes bed frame pairs a low upholstered base with an extra-wide headboard in vertical quilting. The \"Maxi\" is the wide version of the Hermes Bed: the headboard runs well past the sides of the mattress.\nBEFORE YOU ORDER\n It fits a standard American King mattress (76 3/4\" × 80\"). Slats are included and the mattress is not. Measure the wall first: this maxi bed is much wider than the mattress.\nUPHOLSTERY\n Fabrics from the Lario, Lido, Cloud and Vegan Nabuk lines, or leather in categories A, B and C. Square goose feather cushions (19 5/8\" or 15 3/4\") are available on request.",
