  "h1_seo": "Hand-Carved Mother-of-Pearl Steinway Piano by Riva Mobili D'Arte",
  "descripcion_seo": "Among Steinway and Sons pianos, this is a one-of-a-kind dressed piece. Riva Mobili d'Arte covers it in mother-of-pearl, with inlays of precious wood and brass and a deep high-gloss finish. The result is an Italian piano case made to be the centerpiece of a room.\nCRAFT\n A solid wood base, hand-carved in three dimensions and finished in hand-applied gold leaf. The mother-of-pearl changes color with the angle of light. A matching ottoman is included.\nMATCHING PIECES\n The same finish is available on sofas, lounge chairs, consoles and mirrors from the collection.",
